        "\n",
        "## 离散时间信号的高频与低频\n",
        "\n",
        ":::: {.columns style=\"text-align: center;\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "![](imglink/159772dd-711e-4cf6-b135-d8485880c667-12_2.png)\n",
        "\n",
