        "$$x(t) = \\sum_{k=-\\infty}^{+\\infty} a_k e^{j k \\omega_0 t} \\longleftrightarrow a_k = \\frac{1}{T_0} \\int_{T_0} x(t) e^{-j k \\omega_0 t} dt$$\n",
